---
description: CRVR project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root: project overview, rules (never commit to main, commit
after every working step, keep `docs/features/F<n>-*.md` current), stack, layout and commands.

Task-specific instructions are skills in `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (stubs in
`.cursor/skills/`). When a task matches a skill, read the full SKILL.md and follow it.
